
# Splunk Fraud Detection Queries

## 1. Transaction Count by Category

```spl
index=main sourcetype="fraud_detection.csv"
| stats count by category
| sort - count
```

## 2. Fraudulent vs. Legitimate Transactions

```spl
index=main sourcetype="fraud_detection.csv"
| stats count by fraud
```

## 3. Transaction Count by Age

```spl
index=main sourcetype="fraud_detection.csv"
| stats count by age
| sort age
```

## 4. Transaction Count by Merchant

```spl
index=main sourcetype="fraud_detection.csv"
| stats count by merchant
| sort - count
```

## 5. Fraudulent Transactions by Age

```spl
index=main sourcetype="fraud_detection.csv"
| search fraud=1
